      "readme": "# Mouse Cocaine Self-Administration Withdrawal DTI\n\nThis dataset contains diffusion MRI data acquired from mice following cocaine or saline self-administration.\n\nThe dataset includes four subjects:\n- Two cocaine self-administration animals\n- Two saline self-administration animals\n\nOnly the withdrawal imaging time point is included in this dataset.\n\nDiffusion MRI was acquired on a 7 Tesla Bruker MRI system at Michigan State University.\n\nFiles are organized according to the Brain Imaging Data Structure (BIDS).\n",
